  "body": "https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-fetch 5.redirect.10.4\n\n> 1. If either actualResponse's status is 301 or 302 and request's method is `POST`, or actualResponse's status is 303, set request's method to `GET`.\n\nThe body should be removed at this point to avoid a `GET` request with a body.\n",
